<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Bienvenue</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --primary-green: #6fbf73;
        --secondary-green: #4fa35a;
        --background-green: #e9f6ec;
        --text-dark: #1f2937;
        --text-muted: #6b7280;
        --card-white: #ffffff;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        font-family: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
          sans-serif;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          var(--background-green),
          #ffffff
        );
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .card {
        background: var(--card-white);
        max-width: 420px;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
        border-radius: 16px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        text-align: center;
      }

      .logo {
        width: 72px;
        height: 72px;
        margin: 0 auto 1.2rem;
      }

      h1 {
        color: var(--text-dark);
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }

      p {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
      }

      .highlight {
        color: var(--secondary-green);
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .cta {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 1rem;
        padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem;
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          var(--primary-green),
          var(--secondary-green)
        );
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
      }

      .cta:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(79, 163, 90, 0.35);
      }

      footer {
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="card">
      <img src="logo.png" alt="Logo" class="logo" />

      <h1>Bienvenue, {{name}} 👋</h1>

      <p>
        Nous sommes ravis de vous accueillir sur
        <span class="highlight">notre plateforme</span>.
      </p>

      <p>
        Votre inscription a été validée avec succès. Vous pouvez dès maintenant
        commencer à explorer nos services.
      </p>

      <a href="#" class="cta">Commencer maintenant</a>

      <footer>
        L’équipe vous souhaite une excellente expérience 💚
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
